 certificados emitidos por Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/certificates",{"_59":167},"platform/pki/certificates.mdx",{"_33":169,"_40":52,"_35":135,"_46":170,"_55":-7,"_12":171,"_57":172},"es:platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx","Publica el estado de las identidades mediante OCSP y CRL.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation",{"_59":173},"platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx",{"_33":175,"_40":52,"_35":176,"_46":177,"_55":-7,"_12":178,"_57":179},"es:platform/pki/ocsp.mdx","OCSP","Consulta en tiempo real si un certificado sigue vigente o se ha revocado.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/ocsp",{"_59":180},"platform/pki/ocsp.mdx",{"_33":182,"_40":52,"_35":183,"_46":184,"_55":-7,"_12":185,"_57":186},"es:platform/pki/crl.mdx","CRL","Genera y distribuye listas firmadas para validar certificados sin conexión.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/crl",{"_59":187},"platform/pki/crl.mdx",{"_33":189,"_40":52,"_35":135,"_46":190,"_55":-7,"_12":191,"_57":192},"es:platform/pki/device-enrollment.mdx","Define cómo una flota recibe, renueva y utiliza sus identidades.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/device-enrollment",{"_59":193},"platform/pki/device-enrollment.mdx",{"_33":195,"_40":52,"_35":196,"_46":197,"_55":-7,"_12":198,"_57":199},"es:platform/pki/est-enrollment.mdx","EST","Guía del protocolo EST en Lamassu IoT, con la configuración del DMS para el administrador PKI y la referencia de endpoints para el integrador de dispositivos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-28/es/platform/pki/est-enrollment",{"_59":200},"platform/pki/est-enrollment.mdx",{"_33":202,"_40":52,"_35":203,"_46":204,"_55":-7,"_12":13,"_57":205},"es:platform/pki/device-management.mdx","Dispositivos e identidades","Registra dispositivos y controla sus identidades durante todo el ciclo de vida.",{"_59":206},"platform/pki/device-management.mdx",{"_33":208,"_40":52,"_35":209,"_46":210,"_55":-7,"_12":211,"_57":212},"es:platform/pki/alerts.mdx","Alertas y suscripcio